allments_under_DOSBox\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.uesp.net/wiki/General:Playing_DOS_Installments_under_DOSBox </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Earlier installments in the Elder Scrolls series&mdash;Arena, Daggerfall, Battlespire, and Redguard&mdash;were developed for DOS and consequently do not run under modern Windows (nor non-Windows systems, for that matter). This page deals specifically with running these games in DOSBox, and is applicable to all of them. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Daggerfall:Running_under_Windows\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Daggerfall:..._under_Windows</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for that, I'll try it when I finish my Skyrim game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T16:00:30-07:00","id":294247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/292267-the-elder-scrolls-appreciation-discussion-thread?p=294228#post294228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is the Redguard Elder Scrolls game difficult to get running on a modern PC? I ask this as someone who's extremely inept when it comes to computers.</div> </div> </div> </div>From what I read just now, there's an unavoidable crash, unless you buy a piece of third party software.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T16:09:23-07:00","id":294254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Redguard:Redguard\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images.uesp.net/1/1e/RG-cover-Redguard_Box_Art.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Redguard:Redguard\" target=\"_blank\"> The Elder Scrolls Adventures: Redguard - UESP Wiki - The Unofficial Elder Scrolls Pages </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Redguard:Redguard\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Redguard:Redguard </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The Elder Scrolls Adventures: Redguard is the second spin-off game in The Elder Scrolls franchise, set on the island of Stros M'Kai in the Redguard homeland of Hammerfell. In the last days of the Second Era, in the wake of Prince A'tor's defeat and the Imperial occupation of Hammerfell, the mercenary Cyrus returns to his homeland in search of his missing sister Iszara who has disappeared under mysterious circumstances. </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><b>IMPORTANT:</b> While it is possible to run Redguard under DosBox more or less if you play with the configurations long enough, the game will crash for sure if you enter <a href=\"http://www.uesp.net/wiki/Redguard:Confront_N%27Gasta#Clavicus_Vile\" target=\"_blank\">Clavicus Vile's realm</a>. This crash is caused by the core DosBox is emulating. None of the various emulated core-types can prevent this (verified for DosBox v0.73 and 0.74). At the latest at this point you won't be able to proceed with the game. If you don't have access to a true DOS or Windows 95/98 machine there is nothing you can do about this. However with the program Glidos this is possible although it is not free.<br /> <br /> Fortunately I have Windows 95 CD still, I could install it at separate partition if there is ever need.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T16:39:48-07:00","id":294273,"tit